DESCRIPTION:What the hell is Trash MTG!? It’s a Magic The Gathering event
  dual hosted by Netherworld and Vault Games\,but you only get to use your 
 junky cheap cards. Commander with all commons in the 99. We want you to MI
 NE YOUR CARDS you’d otherwise ignore. The ones sitting in shoe boxes at 
 the bottom of a cupboard\, potentially never to see the light of day again
 …until now. If you don’t have quite enough cards to put something toge
 ther\, we’ll have a collection of 10\,000 cards on site you can dig into
  to trade in and out of. Pauper Commander follows the normal Commander rul
 es except… your Commander is an uncommon\, and the rest of the 99 are co
 mmons. Health is a hair lower at 30 and commander damage is 16. In the spi
 rit of ‘Trash MTG’ and an encouragement to use what you have instead o
 f riding the meta wave\, we’ll have a house rule that regardless of the 
 history of the card\, all common cards included must be common according t
 o the card. If you haven’t played Commander before\, the Vault Games and
